atory based on the county 's permit . And I 'll , we 'll address that later . But I want to go back to what Justice Gustafson was talking about . So the prohibition is any other commercial ? It does n't say use . It says purpose , " prohibits any other commercial purpose whatsoever . " So whatsoever is a pretty broad term .	1<2	hypophora	hypophora	query
