GUM_interview_shalev	73-83	84-208	What are you going to talk about here in Levico ?	I called it Character , walks and words . There is a whole topic which is called asymptotic groups theory . There are groups which express the symmetry of some structures . Studying groups is a bit like studying symmetry . It 's very beautiful I think . And then when you do it in an asymptotic way is like you do n't look at the small details . It 's like from the sky . You look at the general patterns . And there is another topic which is very important in mathematics which is called representation theory . So I will mainly talk about how to use a representation theory to solve all kind of problems and conjectures in asymptotic groups theory .	What are you going to talk about here in Levico?	I called it Character, walks and words. There is a whole topic which is called asymptotic groups theory. There are groups which express the symmetry of some structures. Studying groups is a bit like studying symmetry. It's very beautiful I think. And then when you do it in an asymptotic way is like you don't look at the small details. It's like from the sky. You look at the general patterns. And there is another topic which is very important in mathematics which is called representation theory. So I will mainly talk about how to use a representation theory to solve all kind of problems and conjectures in asymptotic groups theory.	73-83	84-208	What are you going to talk about here in Levico ?	I called it Character , walks and words . There is a whole topic which is called asymptotic groups theory . There are groups which express the symmetry of some structures . Studying groups is a bit like studying symmetry . It 's very beautiful I think . And then when you do it in an asymptotic way is like you do n't look at the small details . It 's like from the sky . You look at the general patterns . And there is another topic which is very important in mathematics which is called representation theory . S