GUM_textbook_grit	5-50	51-162	Questions to consider : How do different types of motivation affect my learning ? What is resilience and grit ? How can I apply the Uses and Gratification Theory to make decisions about my learning ? How do I prevent negative bias from hindering learning ?	In this section , you will continue to increase your ability as an informed learner . Here you will explore how much of an influence motivation has on learning , as well as how to use motivation to purposefully take an active role in any learning activity . Rather than passively attempting to absorb new information , you will learn how to make conscious decisions about the methods of learning you will use ( based on what you intend to do with the information ) , how you will select and use learning materials that are appropriate for your needs , and how persistent you will be in the learning activity .	Questions to consider: How do different types of motivation affect my learning? What is resilience and grit? How can I apply the Uses and Gratification Theory to make decisions about my learning? How do I prevent negative bias from hindering learning?	In this section, you will continue to increase your ability as an informed learner. Here you will explore how much of an influence motivation has on learning, as well as how to use motivation to purposefully take an active role in any learning activity. Rather than passively attempting to absorb new information, you will learn how to make conscious decisions about the methods of learning you will use (based on what you intend to do with the information), how you will select and use learning materials that are appropriate for your needs, and how persistent you will be in the learning activity.	5-50	51-162	Questions to consider : How do different types of motivation affect my learning ? What is resilience and grit ? How can I apply the Uses and Gratification Theory to make decisions about my learning ? How do I prevent negative bias from hin